      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners praise the veterinary surgeons and technicians for their approachable nature and attentive treatment. Clients appreciate how medical staff take the time to answer questions and keep owners reassured during surgical drop-offs. While one visitor felt customer service was hurried, the vast majority describe a kind, dedicated clinic team."
      }
