        "en": "Subsidised rates for surgical procedures"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize substantial financial savings on spay and neuter operations, routine vaccinations, and preventative medicines compared to traditional veterinary practices. Clients frequently mention that procedure costs are a fraction of typical quotes, enabling pet owners on tight budgets to afford essential preventive care for their animals."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle approach towards visiting pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients note that doctors and veterinary assistants handle animals with compassion, often sitting on the floor to calm nervous dogs and cats. Owners appreciate that pets receive reassuring care throughout surgical visits and vaccine appointments. While one reviewer reported an uncleaned dog upon pickup, most clients describe gentle and thoughtful handling."
      }
    }
